      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the heads up. i think i can manage with fresh meat. i was also thinking about taking some extra amino acid supplements or maybe just more protein shakes to make up for the stuff i cant eat. if i take a high dose of an amino acid supplement like L-tyrosine with my meds, will that help my mood more or is that bad? i just want to be as proactive as possible with my diet and supplements while i'm on this.",
